### 修真因 1: 渐显渐隐动画保留

**Q32 当前真值** (ticket 22 + 23 落地):
- App.swift providerApiEditor L436-454:
  - L438 HStack(spacing: 8) { SecureField("sk-...", text: $apiDraftKey); Button("保存") {...} }
